  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Northeast Development Program-Tourism</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Desarrollo Nordeste-Tursmo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WILL FINANCE PUBLIC INFRASTRUCTURE INVESTMENTS IN 9 STATES TO SUPPORT PRIVATE SECTOR TOURISM DEVELOPMENT IN THE NORTHEAST. WORKS TO BE FINANCED, PRIMARILY IN AREAS WITH EXISTING TOURISM, INCLUDE WATER SUPPLY, SEWERAGE, TRANSPORTATION, ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION AND RECUPERATION, RECUPERATION OF HISTORICAL PATRIMONY, URBAN WASTE MANAGEMENT AND THE EXPANSION OF 5 AIRPORTS, AS WELL AS ACTIVITIES IN TRAINING AND INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
